<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets Hang Seng Bank warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets Hang Seng Bank warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 128 million American-style call warrants on Hang Seng Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$105.60	 PREMIUM	  22.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.2288	 GEARING	  7.81X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.JAN.98	 PAYDATE	  03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   05.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$96	     MIN EXER LOT   1,000</p>
<p> NOTES		 CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF</p>
<p>			 STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
